### Create MeasurementType — BICEP custom
# @name createMeasurementType
POST {{baseUrl}}/measurement-types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CUSTOM_BICEP",
  "name": "Bícep personalizado",
  "unit": "cm",
  "category": "superior"
}

###

### List all MeasurementTypes
GET {{baseUrl}}/measurement-types

###

### Get MeasurementType by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/measurement-types/{{measurementTypeId}}
